{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2018/06/Singer-Kitchens-Original-Location-hero.webp" alt="Singer Kitchens Original Location" width="1200" height="903" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h1>Singer Kitchens</h1><h2>A New Orleans Tradition Since 1928</h2><div class="el-text"><p>As a local, New Orleans-based business founded in 1928, we understand the importance of family, honesty and integrity.</p><p>4 generations later, Singer Kitchens continues to operate on the principles learned from our founder, Max Singer, who found that eliminating the middleman, offering personalized service, and listening to what customers really want was a great recipe for success. <strong><a href="/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Singer-History-2023.pdf">Click here to read the rest of the Singer Family Story</a></strong>.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><div class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIjlff6ige8" title="About video" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div><div class="el-text"><p>Perhaps that's why customers continue to come back to Singer Kitchens years later, even referring their children and grandchildren to us.</p><p>And, it's a big reason our employees stay with us for decades while we continue to attract the top design and construction professionals from around the metro area to join our team.</p><p>We're here to give you the best New Orleans has to offer... all the things you value, plus industry-leading design and construction expertise in the kitchen renovation field.</p></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
